**Intent:** OPUS drive canon/layout (R14).
**Why:** OPUS 13; AD03/04.

**Scope Included:** Full OPUS Required Reads 0 minus ledger `note` transfers; D20 in full. R14 registrars/tests; unused types: src use→stop/escalate. Mechanical callers only, including three load files; core rollback fixture `version_no`. UPGRADE table, CHANGELOG [Unreleased], EN/RU docs/API golden. Preserve behavior, paths/names/JSON and P1.8 codes; docs/plan historical.

**Scope Excluded:** OPUS/D20 future work: new Actions (P3.3/P3.7/P4.6), controller split (P6.1), DriveConfig (P2.5), recording traits (P5.1), command signatures (P7.2), other handle contract (P3.2/P3.3); other load changes.

**Inputs:** `@plan/knowledge/artifacts-P2-design-P2.2-opus.json`;
`audits/2026-09-29-stable-audit/opus/03-glossary-and-renames.md` (§4);
`audits/2026-09-29-stable-audit/opus/04-packages-and-layout.md` (§4);
`packages/drive/src/DriveHandle.php`;
`packages/drive/tests/Arch/ArchTest.php`.

