**Authority:** routine

**Implementation Rules:** R2 dry-run/log/apply; R3 no aliases; ADR-0017 Law 1/2 green, no new exceptions.

**Code Guidance:** Zero old-map FQNs/paths, removed types/orphans, flat Actions/Data/Exceptions in packages/*/{src,tests,routes}, load/app, docs/{guide,reference,ru}; no old renamed doc names or ShowDriveController::show; domain events, Profile/getId, DriveResource. Live filament StorageResource allowed.

**Validation:**
- Code Guidance → пусто.
- Гейт drive, documents, filament и гейт core → exit 0; сетка P1 на PG → 0 failed, 0 skipped.
- `(cd packages/drive && env $SQ "$R/scripts/php84" vendor/bin/pest --ci tests/Arch tests/Providers)` → 0 failed.

**Deliverables:** Canon, registrars/tests, map/log, docs/golden.
